* CVSD encoder B — no LM311: TL072 open-loop comparator, clamp to HC levels
* Same engine otherwise.
*
* Pins: AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

.subckt cvsd_enc_b AUDIO CLK BIT NBIT Y SYL VDD VCC VEE

* TL072 as comparator with series R to limit saturation depth
Xcmp AUDIO Y VCC VEE CMP_RAW TL072
Rser CMP_RAW CMP_MID 4.7k
Dclp CMP_MID CMP DCLAMP
Rpull CMP VDD 4.7k
Dcln 0 CMP DCLAMP
.model DCLAMP D(IS=1e-14 RS=10)

Xlogic CMP CLK BIT NBIT NCOIN CVSD_LOGIC

R1 NCOIN SYL 51.1k
R2 SYL 0 2.55Meg
Csyl SYL 0 100n

Rvref VDD VA 100
Cvref VA 0 100u
Xoa SYL VA_EMIT VCC VEE BASE TL072
Qp IABC BASE VA_EMIT Q2N3906
Rset VA VA_EMIT 30.9k

Rd1 BIT  INP 47k
Rd2 INP  0   2.2k
Rd3 NBIT INN 47k
Rd4 INN  0   2.2k
Rlin LIN 0 100Meg
Rbin BIN 0 100Meg
Rbuf BUF 0 100Meg
Xota LIN INP INN IABC INT VCC VEE BIN BUF HALF13700

Cint INT 0 10n
Rint INT 0 100k
Xfoll INT Y VCC VEE Y TL072

.ends cvsd_enc_b
